{
  "id": "family-outing-plan",
  "title": "一起規劃出遊",
  "titleEn": "Planning a Family Outing",
  "category": "居家日常",
  "level": "初級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/family-outing-plan.webp",
    "alt": "在溫馨明亮的客廳裡，一家人圍坐在茶几旁開心地討論出遊計畫，桌上放著筆記本、水壺與遮陽帽，大家滿懷期待地規劃登山健行行程。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Friday evening, Dad sits down with the family and smiles, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's plan our ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "trip",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "週五晚上，爸爸和家人一起坐下來微笑著說：「我們來規劃我們的旅行吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f2fd3e965abcd194ef4b32a827af632a891037639d9d637dbdd0da4a291ab3ec",
        "sha256": "51856bea49438e42302dcc681e15d09ff726b1ad5d3bf9e6aba3ef593d1d219c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom opens a notebook and suggests visiting a scenic "
        },
        {
          "text": "mountain",
          "wordIds": [
            "mountain"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " park this weekend."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽打開筆記本，建議這個週末去一座風景優美的山區公園。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "24313fe831d969897d91f422e837845752d0e4ef3d9e5c3f341dd3964ebf6d14",
        "sha256": "14f1a09530008f0a23a3e27c50961e3a0bb331293258fa9d23a1f8f921bd89ec"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad checks his phone and says the "
        },
        {
          "text": "weather",
          "wordIds": [
            "weather"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " will be sunny and clear."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸查看手機並表示天氣將會晴朗無雲。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "49f302d45b7b0b5351e8b67605f8430ab77dd50584039d3242b84f8c83f723b1",
        "sha256": "135995a2eec4d2326a7c568e737fc674385d035d2acbc8699d4fc92b1cb64a7f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily raises her hand excitedly and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What should we ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bring",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 興奮地舉手問道：「我們應該帶什麼？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "dab6c9485fc104453acea218bf0ea421a8788fdfc5ab3a16f0de2cf0c79348c6",
        "sha256": "af9daec356ff177ae2f280eddd67d844f68d746197443aba6527c51ee88b557c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom smiles and reminds everyone, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't forget your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hat",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽微笑著提醒大家：「別忘了你的帽子。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "06a69af710272ce17d105f53d6a9b6fb30f5d3c09436a556c13db5c9d22b3282",
        "sha256": "25bac8d0bbcf405062472e917fb57a0cc115020116dbe34dfccde74502fbeac2"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They also decide to pack sandwiches and water for a pleasant "
        },
        {
          "text": "picnic",
          "wordIds": [
            "picnic"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們還決定準備三明治和水，來一場愉快的外出野餐。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "81bf46daa8bf172c34ad404e8011d575b7e4d833dc8a879c84238f04dd6bec0a",
        "sha256": "0122d5c7f65e471f2e86dce21863e21ef930946de187923f2ee25dca42795d2c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Looking forward to the hike, everyone cheers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be so much fun!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-will-be-so-much-fun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "期待著即將到來的健行，大家一起歡呼：「一定會非常好玩！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-outing-plan/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "18acb0739faacea5c467e0d3e272250a3aa40a5dfc45c02175f4f8bbc3df94c2",
        "sha256": "c94dfe71c343434e5427f239b2744a8e1e2edc8c7e92e610f0b27bed1544e4f6"
      }
    }
  ],
